{"id":"n14068-1-11","stage":3,"title":"신세 · 命","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14068-1-11-1","ko":"돈도 잃고, 자식도 잃고, 어쩌다 내 신세가 이렇게 되었는지.","zh":"钱也丢了，孩子也丢了，不知怎的，我的境遇就变成了这样。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"돈도","meaning":"钱，钱财","explanation":"돈：钱，钱财；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"3","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돈도","audio":"/audio/fd826549ba0afff9b87c.mp3"}},{"text":"잃고,","meaning":"失去","explanation":"잃다：失去；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"잃다","audio":"/audio/03ebbd29f2834d52089e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17177","senseId":"2","lemma":"잃다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잃고","audio":"/audio/0db95aea465fb665723e.mp3"}},{"text":"자식도","meaning":"子女","explanation":"자식：子女；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"자식","audio":"/audio/b642f4b4b990f8387501.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49308","senseId":"1","lemma":"자식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자식도","audio":"/audio/32bf3210009abf0e36a8.mp3"}},{"text":"잃고,","meaning":"失去","explanation":"잃다：失去；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"잃다","audio":"/audio/03ebbd29f2834d52089e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17177","senseId":"2","lemma":"잃다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잃고","audio":"/audio/0db95aea465fb665723e.mp3"}},{"text":"어쩌다","meaning":"指“什么”、“怎么”。","explanation":"어쩌다：指“什么”、“怎么”。","readings":[{"term":"어쩌다","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29765","senseId":"2","lemma":"어쩌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어쩌다","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3"}},{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"신세가","meaning":"命，身世，遭遇","explanation":"신세：命，身世，遭遇；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"신세","audio":"/audio/e5d20b27cc52edfe84bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14068","senseId":"1","lemma":"신세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신세가","audio":"/audio/fff9ffce8eedc1d0a04a.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"되었는지.","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는지：在句末表达未确定的疑问、感慨或自问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되었는지","audio":"/audio/7d206bd093196f734ce9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，钱财","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"财物或财产。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"03ebbd29f2834d52","term":"잃다","zh":"失去","audio":"/audio/03ebbd29f2834d52089e.mp3","entryId":"17177","definition":"原本拥有或享受到的东西被抢走或不再拥有。","pronunciation":["일타"]},{"id":"b642f4b4b990f838","term":"자식","zh":"子女","audio":"/audio/b642f4b4b990f8387501.mp3","entryId":"49308","definition":"儿子和女儿，或单指儿子或女儿。","pronunciation":["자식"]},{"id":"85a8c2b5d5fccc03","term":"어쩌다","zh":"指“什么”、“怎么”。","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3","entryId":"29765","definition":"指“什么”、“怎么”。","pronunciation":["어쩌다"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"e5d20b27cc52edfe","term":"신세","zh":"命，身世，遭遇","audio":"/audio/e5d20b27cc52edfe84bf.mp3","entryId":"14068","definition":"与不幸的事相关的一个人的情况或境遇。","pronunciation":["신세"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/675fbde9c947119d7cf5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14068-1-11-2","ko":"앞으로는 좋은 일이 있을 거예요.","zh":"以后会有好事情发生的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"앞으로는","meaning":"以后，未来","explanation":"앞：以后，未来；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"4","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞으로는","audio":"/audio/686366f0f8b3d7ec59a0.mp3"}},{"text":"좋은","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋은","audio":"/audio/dc3caaaf06a600dc6306.mp3"}},{"text":"일이","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"2","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일이","audio":"/audio/deca3bc3889d43a361ec.mp3"}},{"text":"있을","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있을","audio":"/audio/e77f5d4b360ff618b52e.mp3"}},{"text":"거예요.","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거예요","audio":"/audio/ce83694d33e9399b0229.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"以后，未来","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"将来的时间。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带着某种计划和意图想要实现的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/804d0f84b974332ec309.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.245,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14068","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":118,"sequenceScore":3.0717,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["以后会有好事情发生的。","这次投票的参与人数真的太少了。","钱也丢了，孩子也丢了，不知怎的，我的境遇就变成了这样。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["以后会有好事情发生的。","钱也丢了，孩子也丢了，不知怎的，我的境遇就变成了这样。","这次投票的参与人数真的太少了。"],"answer":0}]}
